emoji": "🫧", "aktion": "pulsieren", "wo": "rechts"}], "sound": "whoosh", "dauer": 1.8, "sprecher": "It fires a jet of water so fast it rips open a bubble."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "Inside: *4,700 °C*", "kulisse": "alarm", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🫧", "aktion": "explodieren", "groesse": "riesig"}, {"emoji": "☀️", "aktion": "kreisen", "wo": "oben", "groesse": "klein", "sagt": "Hey, that's mine!"}], "effekt": "blitz", "dauer": 2.2, "sprecher": "When it collapses, the inside hits around four thousand seven hundred degrees.", "unterzeile": "almost as hot as the sun"}, {"typ": "text", "text": "The shockwave *knocks out* prey", "kulisse": "gras", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🐟", "aktion": "umkippen", "groesse": "gross", "sagt": "Ouch…"}], "comic": "BAM!", "dauer": 1.8, "sprecher": "The shockwave stuns the fish without a single touch."}, {"typ": "text", "text": "It even makes a *flash of light*", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "✨", "aktion": "pulsieren", "groesse": "gross"}, {"emoji": "🦐", "aktion": "wackeln", "wo": "unten", "sagt": "Pew pew!"}], "dauer": 2, "sprecher": "Scientists even caught a tiny flash of light. They call it shrimpoluminescence."}, {"typ": "ende", "text": "Never *mess* with a shrimp", "unterzeile": "Follow for daily nature facts", "kulisse": "nacht", "darsteller": [{"emoji": "🦐", "aktion": "wackeln", "groesse": "gross"}], "dauer": 2.4, "sprecher": "So remember, this shrimp is hotter than the sun."}], "thumbnail": "Hotter than the *sun*?!"}